    1:{"science":"From the plan: the origin of the universe.", "math":"From the plan: area of polygons (triangle, parallelogram, rhombus). This is what the first pieces of the model are cut and measured with.", "social":"From the plan: emotions. That is where a project about what we value starts.", "comunicacion":"From the plan: the sentence and its types.", "english":"From the plan: analysing detailed texts for main ideas.", "tutoria":"From the plan: Magic Day and Día Criollo.", "pe":"From the plan: getting to know handball."},
    2:{"science":"From the plan: the origin of the universe (second week).", "math":"From the plan: 3D solids — prisms, pyramids and polyhedra. The model stops being flat.", "social":"From the plan: customs and citizenship — what a community shares and nobody owns.", "comunicacion":"From the plan: the subject.", "english":"From the plan: discussions and persuasive speech. Preparation for the defence begins.", "art":"From the plan: the single entry loaded in P6 of Grade 5, this week.", "pe":"From the plan: handling and control of the ball."},
    3:{"science":"From the plan: the formation of stars and of the solar system.", "math":"From the plan: nets, faces, edges and vertices. Each solid is opened flat and closed again.", "social":"From the plan: renewable and non-renewable resources. This is where the question of the term opens.", "comunicacion":"From the plan: the predicate.", "pe":"From the plan: passing and receiving."},
    4:{"science":"From the plan: the formation of stars and of the solar system (second week).", "math":"From the plan: circles and circumference, introductory concepts — the orbits of the model.", "social":"From the plan: free goods vs economic goods. That is the distinction the project is named after.", "comunicacion":"From the plan: literal and figurative meaning — the difference between «the light is free» and «the light is priceless».", "tutoria":"From the plan: CREATIVE ARTS SHOW. It falls this week and it takes time away: the model has to be finished in week 3.", "pe":"From the plan: shooting at goal."},
