    3:{"social":"Where my surname comes from, where I live and how my district and my school have changed.", "comunicacion":"The record card about my family and my district, dictated and copied.", "math":"The places in the neighbourhood on a simple map: position and route.", "science":"What is alive in my neighbourhood: first list of living things around us.", "english":"I live in… My school is…", "art":"Drawing of the place in the neighbourhood I like best.", "music":"Traditional family games and songs, from then and from now.", "pe":"Traditional games our grandparents played.", "tutoria":"The traditions in my house: what we do that nobody else does."},
    4:{"social":"The difference between a right and a responsibility; the circle-of-trust tree and what each person does.", "comunicacion":"The interview: preparing two questions and writing down the answer in the other person’s words.", "science":"Who else lives in the school besides us: first question about insects.", "math":"How many people are in my circle of trust: counting and comparing circles.", "english":"This is my… He/She helps me. Thank you.", "art":"The circle-of-trust tree, drawn.", "music":"Teamwork song.", "pe":"Games in pairs: trusting and supporting the other.", "tutoria":"Who I ask for help and how I ask for it."},
    5:{"social":"Exploration walk around the school: what is here that needs protecting and what problem we can see.", "comunicacion":"The thank-you letter to someone in the community: who it goes to and what it asks for.", "science":"Log of what was seen on the walk: what I saw, where and how many.", "math":"Counting the problems found and ordering them from most to least frequent.", "english":"Look at this. Please help us. Thank you for your work.", "art":"Poster of the problem chosen for the video.", "music":"Backing music for the awareness video.", "pe":"The route of the walk: orientation and looking after the group.", "tutoria":"What the classroom needs to stay tidy: agreements."},
    6:{"tutoria":"The basket of magic words and the team cooperation challenge.", "art":"Self-portrait in 3D to close the period, with modelling material.", "comunicacion":"Collective story written by everyone.", "math":"The paper tower: height, base and stability; measuring and comparing.", "science":"Why some towers fall and others do not: first idea of balance.", "social":"Living together: what agreement we need in order to work together.", "english":"Team words: my turn, your turn, well done!", "music":"Yoga and mindfulness with music on the beach trip.", "pe":"Beach trip: cooperative games and looking after the environment."},
