    1:{"social":"«About me» and the differences between classmates: who I am and where I am.", "science":"The term’s research question is framed from what was seen on the walk.", "comunicacion":"The observation card: writing what you see, not what you think about it.", "math":"Counting what was observed on the walk and comparing between areas of the school.", "english":"I can see… I can hear… It is clean / dirty.", "art":"Drawing of the place in the school I like best and the one I like least.", "pe":"Walk around the school: orientation and moving as a group.", "tutoria":"What I like and what I do not like about my school, said without offending anyone."},
